  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup margarine",
    "0.5 cup white sugar",
    "0.5 cup confectioners' sugar",
    "1 egg",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "0.5 teaspoon peppermint extract",
    "2.5 cups all-purpose flour",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "0.5 teaspoon red food coloring",
    "0.5 cup peppermint candy canes, crushed",
    "0.5 cup white sugar for decoration"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KJRPYoN0wQFF9RcBjZZKgfq7gww=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-24443-candy-cane-cookies-iii-VAT-step-01-1a96466b6bcb454ea899c82f43d2a220.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24443/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat butter, white sugar, and confectioners' sugar together in a large bowl with an electric mixer. Beat in egg, vanilla, and peppermint extracts.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8ih11qrYCgkCKeesP4EvZjA5ZBw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-24443-candy-cane-cookies-iii-VAT-step-02-c89cd87f4ef144eca113e9390fcf8c5b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24443/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flour and salt; stir into butter mixture until well blended.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lEjKlVVfuBOILQoaCuZH4TKuOEs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-24443-candy-cane-cookies-iii-VAT-step-03-812ef84edd1242579e5b87ab145aeec5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24443/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover or wrap dough and chill for at least one hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/L9_ChOTHn8ShpX_dwPJBVqcHYN4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-24443-candy-cane-cookies-iii-VAT-step-04-2399bd5a255c4251953efd649b67e84e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24443/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Grease cookie sheets. Divide dough into halves. Color one half red by mixing in the food color.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fCCFf8XDtIwUyx6S6NpbHdcwqw8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-24443-candy-cane-cookies-iii-VAT-step-05-1b6a4dc056e9420aa3f37f95fa692f6f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24443/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll a small amount of each dough into a 2 inch long worm. Roll them together in a twisted rope and curve the end like a cane.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XzzSwWwzyK0Es9jQCFzF23ibybs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-24443-candy-cane-cookies-iii-VAT-step-06-97b081a91bdc43d2bc8e96ade81a04ba.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24443/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place onto prepared cookie sheets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9SsEm8gmKy9mubm7qu4i9yIsNTE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-24443-candy-cane-cookies-iii-VAT-step-07-731bd16c4a2e4eae9b87c37d656c20a8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24443/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until golden brown, about 8 to 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/i5g-q7M8b7jhmF0JjGhHLggR1rw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-24443-candy-cane-cookies-iii-VAT-step-08-cce7b138a00d42ae903c4cc440c0f9fc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24443/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix crushed candy cane and remaining white sugar in a small bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1W6BAR5Ntz-fzqlZbWRNMBID178=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-24443-candy-cane-cookies-iii-VAT-step-09-60352c449b35438eab9d774ee2846abd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24443/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll hot cookies in sugar mixture. Let cookies cool and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
